!Name: edgespark-a1
!C A period 3 c/3 edge spark spaceship.
!C The spark is in the lower left corner and is able to perturb some
!C reactions which grow towards the ship as it passes by.  This is not
!C the smallest form of this ship having this type of spark, but this
!C one has no overhang and so can be used in more places.
!C David I. Bell, November 1999
!Source: jslife-moving
!
